Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.35,0:00:03.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.98,0:00:05.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.79,0:00:07.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My body is...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.98,0:00:09.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.90,0:00:15.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just so you know, \NI only specialize in bomb making.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.45,0:00:19.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll have to take it up with \Nsomeone else to change him ba—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.26,0:00:23.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.29,0:00:25.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.78,0:00:32.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made it so that his composition \Nslowly but surely absorbs oxygen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.32,0:00:37.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enjoy the slow, steady approach of that moment when he explo—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.23,0:00:43.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He doesn't mean it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.89,0:00:45.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My body isn't going to...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.63,0:00:53.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't... move... \NIt's hard... to talk...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.69,0:00:54.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do not move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.76,0:00:56.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alphonse Elric,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.81,0:00:59.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know what has \Nhappened to your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.85,0:01:01.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you carelessly stimulate it—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.88,0:01:04.71,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,You'd best not touch him, scarred man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.59,0:01:07.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Homunculus!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.45,0:01:10.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Homunculus?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.81,0:01:14.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The only thing your arm is capable of is destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.31,0:01:18.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward would be able to transmute the boy into another material
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.61,0:01:21.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and should be able to \Nprevent him from exploding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.31,0:01:23.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Transmute him...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.37,0:01:24.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,into another material?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.95,0:01:25.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.59,0:01:32.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought that your objective was to create a Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.64,0:01:37.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really aren't that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.61,0:01:41.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is no way that \Nshe would say such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.75,0:03:35.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up... Stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.78,0:03:37.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make that thing shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.23,0:03:46.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get up... and walk!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.56,0:03:49.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Move... forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.08,0:03:52.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.30,0:03:55.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.15,0:04:04.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rose! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.53,0:04:08.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go of me! Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.30,0:04:09.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.44,0:04:16.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to allow you to use that arm for any more alchemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.44,0:04:17.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.00,0:04:27.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop that, Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.41,0:04:32.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.07,0:04:44.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.53,0:04:45.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.17,0:04:48.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been wondering \Nabout you for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.34,0:04:52.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You look too much like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.77,0:04:55.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I've been trying to keep myself from thinking about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.52,0:04:57.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trying not to think about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.04,0:05:00.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On that day, did we...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.60,0:05:04.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,create you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.99,0:05:08.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.28,0:05:13.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If so, then you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.21,0:05:16.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,are our sin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.35,0:05:32.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A homunculus...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.67,0:05:35.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you've infiltrated \Nthe military, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.68,0:05:36.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For what purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.73,0:05:39.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you lay a hand on her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.90,0:05:56.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.86,0:06:03.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You went too easy on them. \NHomunculi have more than just one life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.25,0:06:06.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It will take more than that to finish them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.05,0:06:10.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was amazing, Rose!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.50,0:06:13.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your voice is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.32,0:06:16.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.45,0:06:19.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.34,0:06:24.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks to both you and your \Nbaby's voices, I was spared...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.70,0:06:33.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't reach Kimbly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.22,0:06:36.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nor your Chimeras.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.17,0:06:38.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are on a special mission from the Führer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.17,0:06:43.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does it really take this long \Njust to find Fullmetal's corpse
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.57,0:06:45.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and bring it back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.90,0:06:47.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did he and Scar end up \Nkilling each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.84,0:06:50.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or is he just out having fun \Ndestroying things?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.28,0:06:53.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't stand this waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.30,0:07:01.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So this is your command center, \Nis it, Archer?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.33,0:07:03.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're out of line, Mustang!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.66,0:07:05.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.27,0:07:08.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.86,0:07:12.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.00,0:07:15.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.04,0:07:17.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.36,0:07:18.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.42,0:07:20.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.58,0:07:22.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.29,0:07:24.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shou Tucker,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.32,0:07:26.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the Sewing Life Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.81,0:07:28.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.32,0:07:32.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess you couldn't go along with my methods, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.72,0:07:35.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't remember ever \Nsupporting you to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.34,0:07:39.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just had to dip myself in the sludge in order to get the corruption
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.55,0:07:42.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that's rampant throughout the military \Nto rise to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.10,0:07:47.49,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,There's no such thing as a military that \Ndoesn't have any corruption or evil within it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.33,0:07:52.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.72,0:08:06.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What good does it do you, \Npulling a stupid stunt like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.62,0:08:10.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As you were recognized \Nonce upon a time in Ishbal,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.42,0:08:14.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,today, I will be the hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.45,0:08:23.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.95,0:08:29.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're gonna die. They're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.44,0:08:31.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're all gonna die, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.41,0:08:35.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess the depth of \Nthat person's thoughts
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.26,0:08:38.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is lost on the likes of humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.44,0:08:42.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.08,0:08:45.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As long as they get rid of Scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.51,0:08:50.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then again, if they are to become ingredients for the Philosopher's Stone...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.20,0:08:53.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Philosopher's Stone? They're gonna make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.63,0:08:56.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way it will \Nfall into the hands of men.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.68,0:08:59.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In other words, \Nit won't even exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.02,0:09:08.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I can't \Nremember anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.22,0:09:11.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.80,0:09:16.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You are not the woman my brother was trying to bring back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.96,0:09:19.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You just look like her, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.05,0:09:23.40,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Once I become human with the \NPhilosopher's Stone, it will be the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.40,0:09:24.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, it won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.35,0:09:26.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What will be different about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:30.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That which is dead \Ndoes not come back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.71,0:09:36.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you planning to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.47,0:09:38.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.26,0:09:39.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.61,0:09:42.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just be quiet and watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.03,0:10:21.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.07,0:10:29.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I inherited this arm \Nfrom my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.99,0:10:33.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My brother turned himself into a transmutation circle
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.00,0:10:37.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and sealed up the lives of the \NIshbalan people within himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.16,0:10:43.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to transmute the \NPhilosopher's Stone inside himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.49,0:10:47.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And then it was taken on by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.21,0:10:49.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.22,0:10:51.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do not go near him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.65,0:10:57.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is nothing \Nyou can do now but watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.97,0:10:59.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.71,0:11:02.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You intend to turn this boy \Ninto the Philosopher's Stone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.60,0:11:08.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There isn't any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.52,0:11:13.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unless I change his whole body into \Nsome other material, he will explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.60,0:11:15.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you're making him \Nthe Philosopher's Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.30,0:11:18.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want to hand \Na Philosopher's Stone over to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.94,0:11:22.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't even know \Nif I will succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.10,0:11:25.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it is to be, then it will be theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.08,0:11:26.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They may do as they wish with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.34,0:11:31.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.74,0:11:34.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I need you to create a genuine Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.13,0:11:40.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything so absurd \Nas to transmute that boy's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.77,0:11:45.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you kill me here and now, will your wish be fulfilled?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.25,0:11:58.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.20,0:12:03.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If he does create the genuine article, I'll just use it right there and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.67,0:12:09.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no concern of mine what happens to the younger brother, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.71,0:12:16.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother... stop... Scar-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.83,0:12:23.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At this rate, you'll be able to reach a town farther away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.55,0:12:25.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.01,0:12:26.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll have to manage somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.79,0:12:28.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go catch Scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.72,0:12:30.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Scar that the military is after.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.09,0:12:33.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going to turn Scar over to the military?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.77,0:12:38.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's probably the only way the military will let the people of Liore off the hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.72,0:12:41.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, Ed, you can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.73,0:12:43.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know why, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.55,0:12:46.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Equivalent... exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.63,0:12:52.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe there's something I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:56.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know. \NMaybe if I tell the Colonel
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.21,0:12:59.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,about the Führer's secretary from earlier, and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.39,0:13:02.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,whatever, make some \Nkind of deal with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.19,0:13:11.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, don't count on it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.36,0:13:13.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In any case, get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.83,0:13:16.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As far as you can get, \Nbefore the military realizes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.70,0:13:20.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right. That was the plan \Nfrom the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.40,0:13:22.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll split up into small groups
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.39,0:13:24.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and slip our way into \Nother cities someplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.55,0:13:26.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Lyra.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.93,0:13:27.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.26,0:13:30.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See you later, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.36,0:13:31.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.26,0:13:34.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.71,0:13:36.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,this is good-bye, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.60,0:13:48.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no sign of anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.44,0:13:51.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could they be planning a sneak attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.12,0:13:51.27,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.27,0:13:52.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's someone there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.16,0:13:53.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.16,0:13:53.27,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.41,0:14:01.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.80,0:14:03.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a State Alchemist!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.05,0:14:09.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Scar! Scar is there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.47,0:14:14.50,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,That bastard! He murdered the \NState Alchemist who went in to talk to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.98,0:14:17.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have the tank division \Nsurround the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.44,0:14:20.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Infantrymen, capture Scar! Forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.23,0:14:46.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The military was not \Nsupposed to move in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.01,0:14:48.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, \Nit must be the will of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.43,0:14:53.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.57,0:15:15.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.82,0:15:18.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't die that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.07,0:15:20.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.40,0:15:23.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but my body moved on its own...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.64,0:15:28.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were in love... with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.56,0:15:31.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.21,0:15:38.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hated my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.71,0:15:44.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He turned his back on the teachings of Ishbala and studied alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.37,0:15:50.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Despite knowing that he gave me his arm so that I would survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.37,0:15:54.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I still couldn't help but hate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.74,0:16:00.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Elric brothers... \Neach live for the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.37,0:16:03.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.75,0:16:08.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The older loves the younger, \Nand the younger loves the older.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.61,0:16:13.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I also wanted to tell...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.99,0:16:16.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,my older brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.07,0:16:18.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that I loved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.24,0:16:24.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which is why you're doing for that younger brother
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.92,0:16:26.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what your older brother \Ndid for you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.95,0:16:30.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.78,0:16:33.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The despicable act \Nis about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.75,0:16:38.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't even know \Nyour real name...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.19,0:16:43.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our names are something \Nthat are given to us by God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.87,0:16:47.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, as someone who \Nhas turned his back on God,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.13,0:16:48.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I no longer have a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.91,0:16:55.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There he is! It's Scar!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.24,0:16:57.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.88,0:16:57.92,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.05,0:17:04.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.58,0:17:09.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.09,0:17:11.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.02,0:17:14.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.07,0:17:18.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The citizens of Liore surrender! Scar is the only one left!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:21.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Surrender? I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.58,0:17:24.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They killed the Crimson Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.22,0:17:26.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that what your just cause is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.35,0:17:28.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The war has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.93,0:17:30.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can go ahead and die yourself if you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.71,0:17:33.98,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,but don't send those clueless soldiers in there in the name of your worthless lust for glor—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.98,0:17:35.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've spotted someone who appears to be Scar!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.75,0:17:36.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are engaging him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.85,0:17:37.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.15,0:17:40.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.32,0:17:42.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.19,0:17:45.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.55,0:17:53.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Those who give pain cannot sleep."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.21,0:17:58.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, I need not worry about that any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.53,0:18:01.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I shall never seek sleep again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.72,0:18:14.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.09,0:18:44.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.22,0:18:49.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.41,0:18:50.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.30,0:18:54.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\move(360,508,360,524,2670,2870)}You stupid bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.39,0:19:13.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.83,0:19:15.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,More or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.32,0:19:16.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did Colonel Archer \Ntake the division?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.92,0:19:21.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes... and there's something strange about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.11,0:19:24.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The town of Liore \Nlit up a deep red.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.01,0:19:25.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And we can't contact the division.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.50,0:19:38.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that? \NWhat just happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.86,0:19:41.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry and carry away \Nthose who are still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.06,0:19:49.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.90,0:20:01.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.70,0:20:06.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.06,0:20:10.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, no! Stay back! I'm going to explode!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.59,0:20:14.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.05,0:20:15.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.61,0:20:18.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.21,0:20:21.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.23,0:20:24.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm back to normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.96,0:20:28.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, I'm back! \NMy body is back to normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.70,0:20:32.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? I don't know \Nwhat's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.29,0:20:33.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.58,0:20:36.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was turned into \Na bomb by Kimbly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.60,0:20:40.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Scar-san said that if my armor \Nwere transmuted into something else,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.51,0:20:42.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I would be spared, so he...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.15,0:20:46.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, open up your belly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.80,0:20:48.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just open it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:20:58.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.66,0:21:00.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.34,0:21:04.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Moments ago, a transmutation circle \Nwas activated in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.40,0:21:08.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scar has transmuted \Na Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.32,0:21:11.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not inside himself...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.70,0:21:15.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.46,0:21:16.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Little Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.52,0:21:20.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you have been transmuted \Ninto the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.20,0:21:24.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm... the Philosopher's Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.12,0:21:25.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.41,0:21:27.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would he do such a thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.22,0:21:29.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.23,0:21:34.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Soon, they will be after you, and then everything will be set in motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.21,0:21:37.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't you want the \NPhilosopher's Stone as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.45,0:21:59.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.37,0:22:01.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.77,0:22:04.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.80,0:23:40.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.66,0:23:44.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 43: "The Stray Dog"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.57,0:23:48.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.29,0:23:51.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we will come back.
